WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
Stand with feet wide, right foot forward, left foot angled in about 45 degrees.

2
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.200
Square the hips forward and hinge over the right leg.

3
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.800
Place the left hand outside or inside the right foot, on a block if needed.

4
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.400
Reach the right arm skyward and stack the shoulders.

5
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.000
Gaze up or down. Inhale to rise and switch sides.
